Package: know-your-focus
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Chintan Diwakar
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.5), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.14), libgl1, libglib2.0-0t64, libglib2.0-bin, libsm6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, xdg-utils
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Local tracker for focus time, phone use, and away time
 Know Your Focus uses a local camera to measure the time at your
 workstation. It reports focused time, possible phone use, uncertain
 time, and away time. The camera images stay on your computer. The
 GTK 4 and Libadwaita interface obeys the GNOME desktop guidelines.
